# The portable Windows bundle's Python: CPython 3.13 on Windows x64, no
# training stack. It runs the notebook with RUN_GENERATION and
# RUN_TRAINING off, so it needs the runtime's packages, held to the
# runtime lock, plus what the notebook's own cells import (the tokenizer,
# the loss plot) at the notebook lock's versions, plus JupyterLab to open
# it and nbclient and pytest to check it (tools/bundle/check_bundle.py).
-c requirements_lock.txt
